          %h2#idea Idea
          %blockquote
            %p
              One of my early Honours students at
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Macquarie+University"} Macquarie University
              baffled his proposed Queensland graduate studies supervisor who asked whether the student knew the definition of a
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+space"} topological space
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dynamical+system"} dynamical systems
              answered positively: “Yes, it is a relational
              = succeed "-module!\u201D" do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi β
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \beta
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+Kloeden"} Peter Kloeden
              went on to become a full professor of mathematics in Australia then Germany. —
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ross+Street"}> Ross Street
              , in
              %em
                %span.newWikiWord
                  An Australian conspectus of higher categories
                  %a{:href => "/nlab/new/An+Australian+conspectus+of+higher+categories"} ?
          %p
            In
            = succeed "," do
              %a{:href => "#Barr"} 1970
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Barr"} Michael Barr
            gave an abstract definition of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+space"} topological space
            based on a notion of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/convergence"} convergence
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/ultrafilters"} ultrafilters
            (building on work by
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ernest+Manes"} Ernest Manes
            on
            = succeed ")." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/compact+Hausdorff+spaces"} compact Hausdorff spaces
            = succeed "-modules\u2019." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi β
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \beta
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/generalized+multicategory"} generalized multicategory
          %p
            The correctness of this definition (in the sense of matching
            = succeed "'s" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bourbaki"} Bourbaki
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/ultrafilter+principle"} ultrafilter principle
