            are sets, and the horizontal arrows are relations between sets. Vertical arrows are functions between sets, and a 2-cell of shape
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
