                    \&amp; \vdash &amp; \forall_{U: P S} U \in \mathcal{O}_x \Rightarrow \pi_1^{-1}(\hat{U}) \in \mathcal{G}.
                    }
            %p This would naturally follow if
            .maruku-equation
